{"slug":"LNY-Tower-Defense-Simulator-Gatling-gun-Auto-fire-and-shoot-enemies-I-DIDDLER-BETA-121897","_id":"699eb8cc2b8a5be64388b510","title":"Gatling gun Auto fire and shoot enemies I DIDDLER","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77fbe","gameId":3260590327,"name":"[🪓EXE REWORK] Tower Defense Simulator","imageUrl":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://cdn.kocakz.me/images/no-game.webp","original":null},"placeId":3260590327},"features":"| THIS SCRIPT ONLY FOR HIGH UNC EXECUTORS (tested on REAL) \n| PC AND MOBILE SUPPORT\n\nNotes:\n1. advanced\n| It can auto fire - means auto shooting for u, nothing else.\n| auto detect enemies(and checks which detections u have on gatling gun, example if u dont have lead it will not shoot at lead enemies)\n| Auto reload\n| Waiting 5s if theres no enemies - and then reloading(if have ammo)\n\n| Auto toggling fps if u have 2 more gatling guns\n2. Options:\n| Toggle auto fire on/off (off by default)\n\n| bullet per shot(multiplier 1 - any) dont use very high values (high ping issues), recommended 24 maximum, 10 by default\n| cd between shoots( 0 - any) 0.05 by default\n\nAuto target (Farthest, First, Strongest, SmartAmmo):\n  | Farthest - shooting at the end of group of enemies, for pierce. (By default)\n  | First - Best target, choosing first enemy who close to ur base\n  | Strongest - Too obvious, of course its choosing enemy with Highest hp\n  | SmartAmmo - Changing multiplier for fast kill enemy by his hp(may cause high ping)\n\nShow targets(Chams)\n | Just shows who is gatling gun targetting now\n\nSync All gatling guns\n | If another gatling gun didnt handled use this button it will reactivate fps mode\n\nAnd some tips:\nDont turn into fps mode manually (if u did, leave from fps mode and  use button called \"sync all gatling gunz\" or it will not shoot)\nfor better stability(optional) u can: launch script only when u placed gatling gun + no enemies around","tags":["tower defens